%% A state diagram: a download.
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    hide empty description
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Fetching : start
    Fetching --> Done : complete
    Fetching --> Failed : error
    Failed --> Idle : retry
    Done --> [*]
    state "Waiting for the network" as Waiting
    Idle : Nothing queued
    state Fetching {
        [*] --> Headers
        Headers --> Body
        --
        [*] --> Progress
    }
    state split<<fork>>
    state merged<<join>>
    state decide<<choice>>
    note right of Failed : Three attempts at most
